# Deploying workbooks skill

A woven workbook is shipped by running it on a **nexus** — locally for parity, or in
the cloud. The `work` CLI's deploy verbs (`deploy init / validate / apply`) take the
woven tree to a running endpoint. This skill covers the path from a local run to a
cloud deployment.

When the user wants to ship, host, or run a workbook for others, load the references
below.

app :deploying_workbooks do
  title       "Deploying workbooks"
  description "Ship a workbook: run a nexus locally for parity, then deploy local or cloud with the work CLI. Use when the user wants to host, deploy, or run a workbook for others."

  section "What you deploy onto" do
    page "introduction/what-is-workbooks-cloud"
    page "deploy/running-the-nexus"
  end

  section "Deploying" do
    page "deploy/deploy-local-and-cloud"
    page "deploy/workbooks-cloud"
  end
end
